{"id":"NCT07596901","title":"Study of Aritinercept in Patients With Generalized Myasthenia Gravis","official":"A Double-Blind, Randomized, Placebo-Controlled Study to Investigate the Safety and Efficacy of Aritinercept, a Dual BAFF/APRIL Inhibitor, in Patients With Generalized Myasthenia Gravis","summary":"This clinical study will enroll patients with generalized myasthenia gravis (gMG). The goal of this clinical study is to assess the safety, tolerability, effectiveness, pharmacokinetics (how the body processes the drug) and pharmacodynamics (how the drug affects the body) of aritinercept.","conditions":["Myasthenia Gravis, Generalized"],"interventions":[{"type":"DRUG","name":"Aritinercept"},{"type":"OTHER","name":"Placebo"}],"criteria":"Key Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Adult patients (18-85 years old)\n* Myasthenia Gravis Foundation of America (MGFA) Class II-IV gMG\n* Additional inclusion criteria are defined in the protocol\n\nKey Exclusion Criteria:\n\n* Current or medical history of malignancy within the last 5 years\n* Pregnant, breastfeeding or intending to become pregnant during the Study\n* Additional exclusion criteria are defined in the protocol","minAge":"18 Years","maxAge":"85 Years","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"INTERVENTIONAL","purpose":"TREATMENT","enrollment":81,"start":"2026-04-22","pcd":"2029-03-02","upd":"2026-08-03","sponsor":"Aurinia Pharmaceuticals Inc.","areas":["neurology"],"central":["Aurinia Clinical Trials Information · 833-606-5975 · clinicaltrials@auriniapharma.com"],"sites":[{"f":"Aurinia Investigational Site","city":"Pasadena","pr":"California","zip":"91106","s":"R","lat":34.1478,"lon":-118.1445,"c":"Aurinia Clinical Trials Information · 833-606-5975 · clinicaltrials@auriniapharma.com"},{"f":"Aurinia Investigational Site","city":"Altamonte Springs","pr":"Florida","zip":"32714","s":"R","lat":28.6611,"lon":-81.3656,"c":"Aurinia Clinical Trials Information · 833-606-5975 · clinicaltrials@auriniapharma.com"},{"f":"Aurinia Investig